<title>UK: BTR buys majority stake in Chinese venture.</title>
<headline>BTR buys majority stake in Chinese venture.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK conglomerate BTR Plc said on Wednesday it had acquired a majority stake in a Chinese automotive vibration control joint venture for $13 million.</p>
<p>The venture, called Wuxi CSH, is a leading producer of vibration components in China and a sole supplier to Volkswagen and Audi, a major car maker in the region.</p>
<p>The venture's stake will come under BTR's Anti Vibration unit which already has a presence in the U.S., Spain, India, Germany, Brazil and the UK.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 5427717</p>
